component is really key. But I also think it's important for us to remember that our relationship with our career, we spend more time in that relationship than we do in our relationships at home. Just literal hours of the day, more of them are spent at work than they are at home. And, you know, I do a lot of research on stress contagion, how the stress we feel at work can be caught by our family members, by our friends. And the direction tends to go from work to home. That's the stronger direction of stress contagion than home to work. And it's because we spend more time at our jobs, and we do, even with our children, you know, even raising a child or with a loved one. And so I do think it's important to really try to grapple with how much you want to be in love
成分非常关键。但我也认为，有一点对我们来说很重要，那就是要记住，我们与职业的关系——我们花在这段关系里的时间，比我们在家里的关系里花的时间还要多。仅仅从字面上的每天的小时数来看，我们在工作上花的时间比在家里的时间还要多。而且，你知道的，我做了很多关于压力传染的研究，即我们在工作中感受到的压力是如何被我们的家人、朋友所传染的。这种方向往往是从工作到家庭。这是比从家庭到工作更强烈的压力传染方向。这是因为我们在工作上花的时间更多，甚至超过了我们陪伴孩子的时间，甚至超过了我们陪伴所爱之人的时间。因此，我确实认为，认真努力去应对你想对那个东西倾注多少爱

